00:04:27,016 --> 00:04:29,423
locally because we might need to answer some

115
00:04:29,439 --> 00:04:30,017
questions.

116
00:04:30,947 --> 00:04:34,542
So we can start this task locally in plan

117
00:04:34,638 --> 00:04:36,804
mode or in any other mode for that matter,

118
00:04:36,820 --> 00:04:38,633
but plan mode is something you typically

